WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,870
Su Yulan

2
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:02,480
Yesterday, your man took a knife to fight with my brother.

3
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:03,400
How to calculate this account?

4
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,720
I originally said that I would pay back the day after tomorrow.

5
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:05,640
Now I have changed my mind

6
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:08,200
Today, I will take away the money if I can't get the 400 yuan with interest.

7
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,120
Went in and tied someone up

8
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,320
Li Changsheng said he would pay back the money

9
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:17,590
Where are you going? Stop

10
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:29,340
This pig's leg counts as interest. Li Changsheng is treating you harshly.

11
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:30,540
I'll take this pork leg

12
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:37,340
I'll come back to get the money the day after tomorrow, so be patient.

13
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,540
Who just attacked my wife?

14
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,740
Keep your hands or else

15
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,860
No one can leave this yard today

16
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:46,720
I asked again just now

17
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,300
Who touched my daughter Mr. Li? I was wrong.

18
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,620
It's all because Baldy Zhao forced me to do so.

19
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:58,240
I'm just an errand boy. Brother Li, Changsheng, has something to say. I don't want the money.

20
00:00:58,400 --> 00:00:59,680
I don’t dare to ask for that pork leg either.

21
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,920
July July here you tore her apart

22
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:07,560
Let's pay off all our debts. Take your people and get out. Let me see you again.

23
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,680
Half a step into Kaoshantun

24
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,440
I'll cover your whole family

25
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:12,120
Bury this wild boar one by one
